**"Commercial Use"** means any use that is not a Non-Commercial Purpose. It
includes use by or on behalf of a for-profit entity — internal research,
benchmarking and evaluation included — incorporation into a product or service
offered to others, and use in providing services for a fee.

**"Derivative Work"** means a work based on the source code of the Software: a
modified, translated, ported or extended copy of it. Section 5 states what this
does and does not cover.

